<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document Image</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            line-height: 1.4;
            background: #f8f9fa;
        }

        .document {
            width: 8.5in;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 40px 50px;
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 18pt;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 22pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 16pt;
            font-weight: normal;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }

        .date {
            font-size: 12pt;
            text-align: right;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .column {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .left-col {
            width: 48%;
        }

        .right-col {
            width: 48%;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
            padding-bottom: 2px;
        }

        p {
            margin: 8px 0;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .indent {
            text-indent: 20px;
        }

        .placeholder {
            width: 100%;
            height: 180px;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border: 2px dashed #999;
            margin: 15px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            position: relative;
        }

        .placeholder-caption {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 11pt;
            color: #555;
        }

        .signature {
            text-align: right;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 10pt;
            color: #666;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="document">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="title">Sample Document Title</div>
            <div class="subtitle">Subtitle or Additional Header Line</div>
        </div>

        <div class="date">August 2, 2026</div>

        <!-- Two-column layout -->
        <div class="column">
            <!-- Left column -->
            <div class="left-col">
                <div class="section">
                    <div class="section-title">Section 1: Introduction</div>
                    <p>This is the first paragraph of the document. It contains some text and may include a placeholder for a diagram below.</p>
                    <p class="indent">The second paragraph is indented as per standard document formatting.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="section">
                    <div class="section-title">Section 2: Main Content</div>
                    <p>Here is the main body of text. It discusses the primary topic of the document in detail.</p>
                    <p>Additional sentences follow to fill the column space.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right column -->
            <div class="right-col">
                <div class="section">
                    <div class="section-title">Section 3: Supporting Information</div>
                    <p>This column contains supplementary details and references.</p>
                    <p class="indent">Text continues here for proper alignment.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="section">
                    <div class="section-title">Figure 1</div>
                    <div class="placeholder">
                        <div>
                            [Chart / Diagram Placeholder]<br>
                            <span class="placeholder-caption">[Placeholder: Chart centered in right column]</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Separator line -->
        <hr style="margin: 20px 0; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc;">

        <!-- Table -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">Table 1: Data Summary</div>
            <table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                <thead>
                    <tr style="background: #f0f0f0;">
                        <th>Column 1</th>
                        <th>Column 2</th>
                        <th>Column 3</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Row 1</td>
                        <td>Sample Value 1</td>
                        <td>Value A</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Row 2</td>
                        <td>Sample Value 2</td>
                        <td>Value B</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Row 3</td>
                        <td>Sample Value 3</td>
                        <td>Value C</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- Math Example -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">Mathematical Equation</div>
            <p>Here is an example equation rendered with MathJax:</p>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; margin: 15px 0;">
                $$ E = mc^2 $$
            </p>
            <p>Inline math: \( \alpha + \beta = \gamma \).</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Signature -->
        <div class="signature">
            ______________________________<br>
            <span style="font-size: 11pt;">Authorized Signature</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            Document generated from image layout • Page 1 of 1
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
